<header class="rm-head"><h1>Supplier invoice matching</h1><p>Read the saved original, compare its exact products, packs and actual weights with the placed purchase order, physical receipts and earlier bills. No invoice receives stock or pays a supplier. Credits and new prices or terms require their separate owner decisions.</p></header>
<% if(selected){const q=selected,p=q.prepared_input,d=q.document; %>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2><%= q.invoice_number||q.filename %></h2><p><strong><%= ({READY:'Ready for individual approval',EXCEPTION:'Invoice difference',DUPLICATE:'Already recorded',POSTED:'Posted once',HELD:'Needs source review',CREDIT_REVIEW:'Credit note needs owner review',STOPPED:'Stopped',QUEUED:'Queued'})[q.status] %></strong></p><% if(q.problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= q.problem %></p><% } %><p><% if(q.source_upload_id){ %><a href="/autopilot/supplier-invoice-uploads/<%= q.source_upload_id %>/original">Download saved original</a><% }else{ %><a href="/mail/<%= q.message_id %>">Read original email and attachment</a><% } %></p>
<% if(d?.documentType==='credit'){ %><p><a href="/autopilot/supplier-credits/<%= q.id %>">Track this supplier credit</a></p><p>Credit note <%= helpers.money(Math.abs(d.total),d.currency) %> · <%= d.currency %> · <%= d.issueDate %></p><% if(d.originalInvoiceNumber){ %><p>Original invoice reference: <%= d.originalInvoiceNumber %></p><% } %><p><a href="<%= d.originalBill?'/money/bills/'+d.originalBill.id:'/accounting/payables' %>">Review the original bill and any separate credit application</a></p><% } %><% if(p){ %><p><%= helpers.money(p.documentTotalMinor,p.currency) %> · <%= p.currency %> · Issued <%= p.issueDate %> · Due <%= p.dueDate||'not supplied' %></p><% if(!d?.dueDate&&p.dueDate){ %><p>The due date is calculated from the original invoice date and stated or saved supplier payment terms.</p><% } %><% if(p.sourcePaymentTerms){ %><p>Original payment terms: <%= p.sourcePaymentTerms %></p><% } %><p><a href="/purchasing/orders/<%= p.purchaseOrderId %>">Approved purchase order and physical receipts</a></p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Stock quantity</th><th>Actual weight</th><th>Price</th><th>Original amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const [index,l] of p.lines.entries()){ %><tr><th scope="row"><%= l.description %><% if(l.lotCode){ %><small> · Lot <%= l.lotCode %></small><% } %><% if(l.serials?.length){ %><small> · Serials <%= l.serials.join(", ") %></small><% } %></th><td><%= l.quantity %> <%= l.unitLabel||'' %></td><td><%= l.secondaryQuantity??'—' %> <%= l.secondaryQuantity!=null?l.secondaryUnitLabel||'':'' %></td><td><%= helpers.money(l.unitCostMinor,p.currency) %> per <%= l.priceQuantity||1 %> <%= l.secondaryUnitLabel||l.unitLabel||'pricing units' %></td><td><%= (d?.rows?.[index]?.sourceLineTotalMinor??l.documentLineTotalMinor)==null?'From exact quantity and price':helpers.money(d?.rows?.[index]?.sourceLineTotalMinor??l.documentLineTotalMinor,p.currency) %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><% for(const c of p.charges||[]){ %><p><%= c.label %>: <%= helpers.money(c.amountMinor,p.currency) %></p><% } %><p>Tax: <%= helpers.money(p.taxMinor,p.currency) %></p><% } %>
<% if(q.comparison?.differences?.length){ %><h3>Comparison with current records</h3><ul><% for(const e of q.comparison.differences){ %><li><%= e.line?'Line '+e.line+': ':'' %><%= differenceLabel(e.kind) %><%= e.approved?' — separately approved for this invoice':'' %><% if(e.received!=null){ %> Received: <%= e.received %>; already billed: <%= e.previouslyBilled %>; invoice: <%= e.billed %>.<% } %></li><% } %></ul><% } %>
<% if(q.bill_id||q.duplicate_bill_id){ %><p><a href="/accounting/payables/<%= q.bill_id||q.duplicate_bill_id %>/review">Read the existing canonical supplier bill</a></p><% } %>
<% if(!['POSTED','STOPPED','DUPLICATE','CREDIT_REVIEW'].includes(q.status)){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>/recheck"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn secondary">Recheck current records</button></form><% if(p&&q.comparison&&!q.duplicate_bill_id){ %><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>/approve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= q.revision %>"><input type="hidden" name="matchFingerprint" value="<%= q.comparison.matchFingerprint %>"><label>Evidence reviewed <input name="reason" required maxlength="1000" placeholder="Record the original, PO and physical receipt evidence checked"></label><% if((p.charges||[]).length||p.taxMinor){ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="approveCharges" value="yes"> I approve these exact invoice charges and tax that were not already agreed on this purchase order.</label><% } %><% if(q.comparison.differences.some(e=>['price_outside_approved_cost','invoice_exceeds_receipt_value','invoice_receipt_value_differs'].includes(e.kind))){ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="approvePrices" value="yes"> I approve this single invoice’s exact price or rounding variance as an expense. Keep original PO prices and stock value unchanged.</label><% } %><% if(q.comparison.differences.some(e=>e.kind==='earlier_invoice_tracking_unclear')){ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="approveTracking" value="yes"> I checked the earlier invoice originals and confirm this invoice’s exact lot or serial allocation. Existing duplicate or missing physical evidence must still be resolved.</label><% } %><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirm this exact invoice original, its due date and the current receipt comparison. No payment or credit is authorized.</label><button class="btn">Approve and record this invoice</button></form><% } %><% if(q.duplicate_bill_id){ %><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>/replaceUnposted"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= q.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> This corrected source replaces the exact unposted disputed original. Preserve and void that original, then compare this document again.</label><button class="btn secondary">Review corrected unposted invoice</button><p>Posted originals require a separately approved supplier credit or accounting correction.</p></form><% } %><% } %>
<% if(['HELD','READY','EXCEPTION','CREDIT_REVIEW'].includes(q.status)){const amount=n=>d?.currency&&n!=null?invoiceCurrency.fromMinor(n,d.currency):'';const lineRows=d?.rows?.length?d.rows:[{}]; %>
<details class="card"><summary class="card-head">Confirm unclear source fields</summary><div class="card-body"><p>Read the retained original and copy every invoice line. Confirming an uploaded original’s exact PO also corrects an earlier selection mistake, reusing its document receipt. Only existing suppliers and placed orders can be selected. Credit notes can retain an amount and original bill reference without an item breakdown. This confirms the source reading; StockChief will compare your confirmed fields again before any bill can post.</p><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>/clarify" data-invoice-reading><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= q.revision %>">
<label>Document type <select name="documentType"><option value="invoice">Supplier invoice</option><option value="credit" <%= d?.documentType==='credit'?'selected':'' %>>Supplier credit note</option></select></label><label>Invoice or credit number <input name="invoiceNumber" value="<%= d?.invoiceNumber||'' %>" required></label><label>Original invoice credited, if stated <input name="originalInvoiceNumber" value="<%= d?.originalInvoiceNumber||'' %>"></label><% if(d?.documentType==='credit'){ %><label>Supplier return reference, if stated <input name="supplierReturnReference" value="<%= d.supplierReturnReference||'' %>"></label><% } %><label>Original purchase order number <input name="purchaseOrder" value="<%= d?.purchaseOrder||'' %>" required></label><label>Currency <input name="currency" value="<%= d?.currency||'' %>" required minlength="3" maxlength="3"></label><label>Invoice date <input type="date" name="issueDate" value="<%= d?.issueDate||'' %>" required></label><label>Due date, if supplied <input type="date" name="dueDate" value="<%= d?.dueDate||'' %>"></label>
<label>Original payment terms, if stated <input name="paymentTerms" value="<%= d?.paymentTerms||'' %>"></label><div data-reading-lines><% for(const l of lineRows){ %><fieldset data-reading-line><legend>Original product line</legend><label>Exact product or supplier code <input name="lineCode" value="<%= l.code||'' %>" required></label><label>Original description <input name="lineDescription" value="<%= l.description||'' %>"></label><label>Quantity <input name="lineQuantity" value="<%= l.quantity??'' %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label><label>Quantity basis <select name="lineBasis"><option value="stock">Stocking units</option><option value="purchase" <%= l.quantityBasis==='purchase'?'selected':'' %>>Purchase packs</option></select></label><label>Actual measured weight, where applicable <input name="lineWeight" value="<%= l.secondaryQuantity??'' %>" inputmode="decimal"></label><label>Original lot or batch, if stated <input name="lineLot" value="<%= l.lotCode||'' %>"></label><label>Original serials, one per line <textarea name="lineSerials"><%= (l.serials||[]).join('\n') %></textarea></label><label>Unit price before separately recorded tax <input name="linePrice" value="<%= amount(l.unitCostMinor) %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label><label>Pricing units per original price, if stated <input name="linePriceQuantity" value="<%= l.priceQuantity??'' %>" inputmode="decimal"></label><label>Goods amount before separate discount and tax <input name="lineTotal" value="<%= amount(l.lineTotalMinor) %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-remove-reading-line>Remove this line</button></fieldset><% } %></div><button type="button" class="btn secondary" data-add-reading-line>Add another source line</button>
<% for(const [field,label,kind]of [['tax','Tax','tax'],['freight','Freight','freight'],['insurance','Insurance','insurance'],['duty','Duty','duty'],['discount','Discount','discount'],['otherCharge','Other charge','other']]){const n=field==='tax'?d?.tax:d?.charges?.filter(c=>c.kind===kind).reduce((n,c)=>n+Math.abs(c.amountMinor),0); %><label><%= label %> <input name="<%= field %>" value="<%= amount(n) %>" inputmode="decimal"></label><% } %><label>Original document total <input name="total" value="<%= amount(d?.total) %>" inputmode="decimal" required></label><label>What you checked <input name="reason" required maxlength="1000" placeholder="Explain the exact original fields confirmed"></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I read the original and confirm these exact fields. No physical receipt, payment, refund, credit application or future price is authorized.</label><button class="btn">Compare confirmed source fields</button></form></div></details><script src="/supplier-invoice-reading.js" defer></script><% } %>
<% if(!['POSTED','STOPPED'].includes(q.status)){ %><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>/stop"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= q.revision %>"><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Stop processing this exact source and keep its original.</label><button class="btn secondary">Stop this source</button></form><% } %></div></section><% } %>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Upload an original invoice</h2><p>Choose the confirmed supplier’s exact placed PO. PDF, Word, Excel, HTML, CSV, text, scans and photos are supported. Each original uses one document allowance; retries reuse its receipt. Files stay private.</p><form class="form-stack" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/upload"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Purchase order number <input name="purchaseOrderReference" required></label><label>Complete original invoice <input type="file" name="invoiceFile" required accept=".pdf,.docx,.xlsx,.xls,.csv,.tsv,.txt,.html,.htm,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.heic,.heif,.tiff,.tif"></label><button class="btn">Save and read this invoice</button></form><% for(const u of uploads){ %><article><h3><%= u.filename %></h3><p><%= u.status==='PENDING'?'Queued for reading':u.status==='STOPPED'?'Stopped; original retained':u.status==='READABLE'?'Read; waiting for matching':'Source needs attention' %></p><% if(u.problem){ %><p class="notice"><%= u.problem %></p><% } %><% if(u.status!=='STOPPED'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoice-uploads/<%= u.id %>/retry"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn secondary">Retry this saved original</button></form><% if(u.status!=='READABLE'){ %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoice-uploads/<%= u.id %>/stop"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn secondary">Stop this unread source</button></form><% } %><% } %></article><% } %></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Match arriving supplier invoices</h2><p>Starter and Growth approve each supplier bill. Pro and Custom can post clear matches without teaching after 14 days, with Handle routine work enabled both for the inventory and supplier-invoice job. New prices, unagreed charges, unclear originals, credits and missing receipts wait for review.</p><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= settings?.revision||0 %>"><% for(const m of mailboxes){ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="connectorIds" value="<%= m.id %>" <%= settings?.connector_ids?.includes(m.id)?'checked':'' %>> <%= m.display_name %></label><% } %><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> Prepare private matches from the confirmed supplier originals arriving in these mailboxes.</label><div class="actions"><button class="btn">Enable source matching</button><% if(settings?.enabled){ %><button class="btn secondary" name="stop" value="yes" formnovalidate>Stop mailbox matching</button><% } %></div></form><p><a href="/autopilot/job-modes">Review per-job authority</a></p></div></section>
<section class="card"><div class="card-body"><h2>Invoice originals and outcomes</h2><% if(!rows.length){ %><p>No saved invoice source reviews are on this page.</p><% } %><% for(const q of rows){ %><article><h3><a href="/autopilot/supplier-invoices/<%= q.id %>"><%= q.invoice_number||q.filename %></a></h3><p><%= q.supplier_name||'Supplier needs confirmation' %> · <%= ({READY:'Ready for approval',HELD:'Needs source review',EXCEPTION:'Invoice difference',DUPLICATE:'Already recorded',POSTED:'Posted once',STOPPED:'Stopped',CREDIT_REVIEW:'Credit note needs owner review',QUEUED:'Queued'})[q.status] %></p><% if(q.problem){ %><p><%= q.problem %></p><% } %></article><% } %></div></section><nav class="actions"><% if(page>1){ %><a class="btn secondary" href="?page=<%= page-1 %>">Previous page</a><% } %><% if(more){ %><a class="btn secondary" href="?page=<%= page+1 %>">Next page</a><% } %></nav>
